{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261117/photo/bkn-20261117101418112-1117_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261117102559\"/><p>APEC領導人會議周新聞中心吹風會在深圳舉行。</p><p>亞太經合組織（APEC）領導人會議周新聞中心第5場吹風會周二（17日）舉行，2026年APEC高官會主席陳旭表示，深圳APEC領導人非正式會議即將舉行，會議成果文件的磋商工作已啟動。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T02:46:50.933504+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T02:14:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T02:40:26.805806+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T02:40:26.805806+00:00","content_hash":"150a4a82eacef72ad9652396dad7b9f3838458cce45febbb9223f5a95976298d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}